OL,3,GNEWSALove is Blind couple on ADHD, and
OL,4,Alife on Guernsey
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple who appeared in a reality
OL,7,Fdating show have told of their
OL,8,F"amazing" life on Guernsey one year
OL,9,Fafter they first met on the show.
OL,11,FJack Bradshaw, 30, and Faye Domaille,
OL,12,F28, featured in series three of
OL,13,FNetflix's Love is Blind: UK, and have
OL,14,Fremained together despite the show's
OL,15,Flow success rate.
