OL,3,GNEWSALove is Blind couple on ADHD, and
OL,4,Alife on Guernsey
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe format sees singles date each other
OL,7,Fin pods but they are separated by a
OL,8,Fwall. They can only see one another
OL,9,Fafter they get engaged, and then have
OL,10,Fto navigate a honeymoon, moving in
OL,11,Ftogether, meeting families, and a
OL,12,Flegally binding wedding.
OL,14,FDuring the show psychologists helped
OL,15,FBradshaw come to terms with having
OL,16,FADHD. The pair have since moved in with
OL,17,FDomaille's parents in St Saviour.
